"QD2_P"		Acceleration of platform pitch tilt rotation DOF
"QD2_TFA1"
"QD2_GeAz"
TwHt1ALxt		Local tower fore-aft (translational) acceleration (absolute) of tower gage 1 	Directed along the local xt-axis	(m/s^2)
TwHt1ALzt		Local tower axial (translational) acceleration (absolute) of tower gage 1 	Directed along the local zt-axis	(m/s^2)
TwHt5ALxt		Local tower fore-aft (translational) acceleration (absolute) of tower gage 5	Directed along the local xt-axis	(m/s^2)
